---
// 旧主题遗留路径：/contact -> /en/contact
// 使用静态 HTML meta refresh 重定向
---
<html>
<head>
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/en/contact">
  <link rel="canonical" href="/en/contact">
  <title>Redirecting to Contact Page</title>
</head>
<body>
  <p>Redirecting to <a href="/en/contact">Contact page</a>...</p>
</body>
</html>